    /**
     * Calculates the weighted amount (Amount * Probability / 100) for the given opportunities.
     * Delegates to the service implementation obtained from the Application factory.
     *
     * @param opportunityIds Set of Opportunity Ids to evaluate. If null or empty, returns an empty map.
